BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Gentle Yoga @ Group Exercise Room
DTSTART:20261113T163000Z
DTEND:20261113T173000Z
DTSTAMP:20261108T154807Z
UID:leominster-friday-november-13-2026-1130am-1230pm-gentle-yoga@ymcaofcm-
 7024
CATEGORIES:Group Exercise
DESCRIPTION:Category: Group Exercise\nStudio: Group Exercise Room\nGentle 
 Yoga emphasizes safety through proper alignment in basic postures\, breath
  awareness\, and relaxation. Gentle Yoga is recommended for newcomers\, th
